  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Finely chop cucumber.\n• Grate carrot.\n• Drain and rinse kidney beans.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68782fec5a587f17f45955b4/step-9d13ad00.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Heat a large frying pan over medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil.\n• Cook carrot and kidney beans until tender, 3-4 mins.\n• Add spicy taco seasoning (the spice blend is hot, use less if you’re sensitive to heat!) and tomato paste and cook until fragrant, 1-2 mins.\n• Reduce heat to medium, then stir through the water and cook until slightly thickened, 1 min. Season with salt and pepper to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68782fec5a587f17f45955b4/step-10c12d10.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large bowl, combine shredded cabbage mix, the mayonnaise, a drizzle of olive oil and a pinch of salt.\n• In a medium bowl, combine cucumber and a drizzle of white wine vinegar and olive oil. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68782fec5a587f17f45955b4/step-d520f520.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Microwave mini flour tortillas on a microwave-safe plate in 10 second bursts until warmed through.\n• Build tacos by filling tortillas with Mexican beans, creamy slaw and zingy cucumber to serve.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68782fec5a587f17f45955b4/step-6e46a930.jpeg"
    }
  ]
